{"clause_id": "c034", "issues": [
  {"issue": "'Accepted Master Servicing Practices' is defined by reference to 'customary mortgage servicing practices of prudent mortgage servicing institutions', an external and unquantified standard whose content is a classic subject of dispute in servicing litigation. Neither 'customary' nor 'prudent' has any benchmark fixed in the Agreement.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.35},
